{"id":"bid-close","title":"Two lowest bids within 2% of each other","question":"On which contracts did the runner-up miss by a hair?","finding":"On 15 of 92 contested lists the second-lowest price was within 2% of the lowest; the closest pair were $1,064 apart on a $2.7 million job (Michael O'Shaughnessy Construction, Inc. and A. Ruiz Construction Company).","how":"Second-lowest tabulated total price divided by the lowest, where both come from different firms.","limits":"The sample is small: 108 bid lists (71 Public Works 2022–26, 15 Port, 22 Muni), only contracts large enough to go to a commission with the tabulation attached. The airport and the water department publish none without a login. Tight bids are what healthy competition on unit-price paving and signal work looks like, because firms price the same quantities from the same published cost books. Close bids matter only together with other signs, such as the same firms alternating as winner.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"agency","t":"Agency","type":"text"},{"k":"date","t":"Bids opened","type":"date"},{"k":"contract","t":"Contract","type":"text"},{"k":"bidders","t":"Bidders","type":"int"},{"k":"low","t":"Lowest","type":"org"},{"k":"bid","t":"Bid","type":"usd"},{"k":"second","t":"Second","type":"org"},{"k":"secondBid","t":"Bid","type":"usd"},{"k":"gap","t":"Apart by","type":"usd"},{"k":"gapShare","t":"Gap","type":"pct"},{"k":"doc","t":"Source","type":"link"}],"rows":[{"agency":"Public Works","date":"2025-03-25","contract":"Various Locations Pavement Renovation No. 79 and Sewer Replacement","bidders":5,"low":"Michael O'Shaughnessy Construction, Inc.","bid":2717372,"second":"A. Ruiz Construction Company","secondBid":2718436,"gap":1064,"gapShare":0.0004,"doc":{"t":"bid sheet","u":"https://sfpublicworks.org/sites/default/files/Commissions/July%2024%2C%202025/Item%204b_PWC%20VL%20Pavement%20Renovation%20No%2079%20Attachments%207-24-25%20v717.pdf"}},{"agency":"Public Works","date":"2026-02-18","contract":"Contr